        },
        {
          "text": "Lino ba-Musa a-Aroni bakacita mbubonya mbuli Jehova mbwaakalailila, Wakabweza musako, wauma maanzi aamulwizi, mumeso aa-Farao amumeso aabalanda bakwe, nkabela maanzi oonse aamulwizi akasanduka kuba bulowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
