              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Azyalo inswi zyamulwizi zyakafwa, alimwi lwizi lwakanunka. Ba-Egepita bakakacilwa kunywa maanzi aamulwizi. Mucisi coonse buyo ca-Egepita mwakali bulowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pele basimabibo ba-Egepita abalo bakacita mbubonya abo amabibo aabo, aboobo moyo wa-Farao wakayuma, nkabela wakakaka kubaswiilila, mbubonya mbuli Jehova mbwaakaamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
